# Profile notes: primary claims use the did:demos:agent ClaimReference profile
# (src/catalog/claimRef.ts), which the pinned revision does not yet define. It comes from
# DACS-Standard #296, merged into `next` at 725fa78bd124a7adb65df27adee376d5d44a4bd7; its fixture
# is vendored below. Its keys are Ed25519, so artifacts signed with ecdsa-secp256k1 or
# sr1-aggregate cannot be verified under this profile and are not published or counted.
# Recorded deviations (test/standard-vectors.test.ts pins each):
#   §8.5.2 checks 5-6 need the CommitmentRecord's anchored committedAt, which a bundle does not
#     reference: a session whose listing sets deadlineSecAfterCommit or validity.notAfter is
#     indeterminate and never counted.
#   CD-1: a non-canonical amount (e.g. "95.00") is rejected rather than canonicalised (fail-closed).
#   agreement-listing-v0.1 `fractional-pct-out` expects reject; the §8.5.2 text (round to the CD-1
#     digits of bandCenter) accepts it, and the Directory follows the text.
#   SB-1: the evm and x402 ChainTxRef variants carry no logIndex, so their references are `error`
#     and the deal is not counted.
